## Requirements
General

Python 3.13 or 3.14

Two separate virtual environments (recommended)

Microsoft Agent Framework client

OpenAI API key

ADK server

Either a Gemini API key

Or Vertex AI credentials

Or a tool-only ADK agent (no LLM)

## 1. ADK Server (A2A Provider)
Setup
```
cd adk_server
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
```
```
pip install "google-adk[a2a]"
```
Authentication (choose one)
Option A: Gemini API (simplest)
```
export GOOGLE_API_KEY="your-gemini-api-key"
```
Option B: Vertex AI
```
export GOOGLE_GENAI_USE_VERTEXAI=true
export GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT="your-project-id"
export GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION="europe-west1"
```
```
gcloud auth application-default login
```
Run the A2A server
```
adk api_server --a2a --port 8001 remote_a2a
```
Verify agent card
```
curl http://localhost:8001/a2a/check_prime_agent/.well-known/agent-card.json
```

If this returns JSON, the A2A server is ready.

2. Microsoft Agent Framework Client
Setup
```
cd ms_client
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
```
```
pip install --upgrade pip
```
```
pip install --pre \
  "agent-framework-core==1.0.0b251216" \
  "agent-framework-a2a==1.0.0b251216"
```
```
pip install openai httpx
````

Note: We intentionally do not install the full agent-framework bundle to avoid Redis dependencies that are incompatible with Python 3.14.

Environment variables
```
export OPENAI_API_KEY="your-openai-api-key"
export OPENAI_CHAT_MODEL_ID="gpt-4o-mini"
```
Run the demo
```
python demo.py
```

Example output:

97 is a prime number.

What This Demo Proves

A Microsoft Agent Framework agent can:

Discover an external agent via an agent card

Wrap it as an A2AAgent

Expose it as a tool to an OpenAI-backed ChatAgent

A Google ADK agent can:

Act as a fully compliant A2A server

Serve agent metadata

Execute logic on behalf of remote agents

No shared SDK, runtime, or model is required

Why This Matters

This setup demonstrates:

Vendor-neutral agent interoperability

Clear separation between agent reasoning and agent execution

A practical pattern for:

agent marketplaces

agent delegation

cross-platform agent ecosystems

security and observability experiments

Common Pitfalls
Missing Gemini / Vertex credentials

If you see:

ValueError: Missing key inputs argument!


You forgot to configure authentication for the ADK server.

Python 3.14 dependency conflicts

Avoid installing the full agent-framework meta-package on Python 3.14.
Install only the required sub-packages (core, a2a).

